<title>USA: Gray announces WITN-TV acquisition.</title>
<headline>Gray announces WITN-TV acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>ALBANY, Ga. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gray Communications Systems said on Monday it completed its acquisition of WITN-TV, Washington, North Carolina from Raycom-U.S. Inc.</p>
<p>WITN-TV operates on Channel 7 and is the NBC affiliate in the Greenville-Washington-New Bern, North Carolina market. Until earlier this year, the station was owned by the AFLAC Television Group.</p>
<p>WITN-TV complements Gray's existing group of stations, located primarily in the southeastern United States.</p>
<p>Gray Communications Systems Inc is a southeastern United States communications company located in Albany, Ga., which operates three NBC- affiliated television stations among other stations.</p>
</text>
